      "content": " Note: The alarms log will retain the latest 40 alarm and malfunction codes, listed in order from the most current to the oldest."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0103",
      "reading_order": 121,
      "section": "ALARMS LOG",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99917432690002,
        "t": 655.8031670659,
        "r": 414.5961701548999,
        "b": 646.9077351839328
      },
      "content": "To view the alarms log, see Figure 1-3 , then proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0104",
      "reading_order": 122,
      "section": "ALARMS LOG",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.57948837780003,
        "t": 631.8034273697999,
        "r": 443.22701570070006,
        "b": 622.9079954878327
      },
      "content": "Access the biomed settings screen as described in Section 1.9 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0105",
      "reading_order": 123,
      "section": "ALARMS LOG",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.57938877770005,
        "t": 616.3235798277999,
        "r": 342.5075101767999,
        "b": 607.4281479458327
      },
      "content": "Select Alarms Log , and press [CHOOSE]."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0106",
      "reading_order": 124,
      "section": "ALARMS LOG",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58048437880007,
        "t": 600.9034923457999,
        "r": 483.1806994147996,
        "b": 592.0080604638327
      },
      "content": "Use the [PAGE UP] and [PAGE DOWN] softkeys to view the alarms log."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0107",
      "reading_order": 125,
      "section": "ALARMS LOG",
      "bbox": {
